  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Children are mapped as 'leftover cereal pieces'",
  "description": "The text 'when you have 3 choco puffs left in your cereal bowl' is mapped onto the visual of the three children. The meme equates the children with the last three cereal pieces, implying they are 'leftover' or 'waste'. This is a dehumanizing analogy that infantilizes and racializes the children, reducing their humanity to a mundane, childish object. The visual of the children, who are presented with dignity and cultural pride, is used to mock a mundane situation, creating a harmful and offensive mapping.",
